                                                "sense_id": "d59e1540-b732-3e69-bc9b-c4ba396a8ae8",
                                                "text": "If your favorite Succession storylines involve the fictional ATN and network drama, give Apple TV’s The Morning Show a stream."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f24e9d5e-10a2-35c4-87a3-757ee9ca8ffb",
                                        "entry_id": "b421a6a8-f0ee-346e-92ec-71d23a3ef70f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Digital data (e.g. music or video) delivered in a continuous manner to a client computer, intended for immediate consumption or playback.",
                                            "A live stream."
